4 person to Remakri go through sangu river for 2.5 hours . We saw Tindu, Boro pathor area. Shuch amazing places! After reaching Remakri Bazar, we started for Nafakhum.  After 2 hours trekking we reached Nafakhum . We stayed at  Oulawa Para for whole night.\nOverall experience was great indeed. This can be a perfect tour for adventure lovers. Bandarban to Thanchi Jeep fare: 5000 Tk.  Thanchi to remakry by boat: 5000-6000 Tk/ 4 person. Remakry night stay:150-200/ person in local inhabitant's home. Food: 100-150/ per person in every meal time. Tips: Don't mis behave with locals. #bandarban #nafakhum #waterfall #bangladesh", "channel_id": "UC3wOI8PQZbQh7nQcmc_DonA", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3wOI8PQZbQh7nQcmc_DonA", "duration": 65, "view_count": 81, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bUQrkMqH4aw", "categories": ["Music"], "tags": ["@Nafakhum waterfall"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "like_count": 1, "channel": "O Vibes ", "channel_follower_count": 655, "uploader": "O Vibes ", "uploader_id": "@voiceofmy007", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@voiceofmy007", "upload_date": "20181110", "timestamp": 1541847263, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Youtube", "display_id": "bUQrkMqH4aw", "fulltitle": "Nafakhum waterfall ( নাফাখুম জলপ্রপাত)  Beautiful place in Bangladesh. Tanchi, Bandorbon.", "duration_string": "1:05", "is_live": false, "was_live": false, "epoch": 1781109066, "asr": 44100, "format_id": "18", "format_note": "360p", "source_preference": -1, "fps": 25, "audio_channels": 2, "height": 360, "quality": 6.0, "has_drm": false, "tbr": 755.651, "filesize_approx": 6156477, "width": 640, "language_preference"